<title>UK: Zurcher Kantonalbank adds 50 mln Sfr to 8-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Zurcher Kantonalbank adds 50 mln Sfr to 8-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Zurcher Kantonalbank, has been increased to 200 million Swiss francs from 150 million francs.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ZURCHER KANTONALBANK SERIES 86</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    29.JUL.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.45    PAY DATE    29.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5	   EOS	   15.JUL.97</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SWISS     LISTING    EBS	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE IS A REOPENING CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
